+- New **Media Player** (**shared** between Sevopedia Movies and Music): supports **Replay**, **Eject (Exit)**, **Previous Track** and **Next track**, **Toggle Movies/Music**, **Fast Up** and **Fast Down** (change grouping), **Timer**, and a **Playlist** and a **TV panel** on the right side for **non-bik** files (e.g., for **nif**, **dds**), or **a more compact** queue form **for bik files**. This allows to view without having to exit the screen. Click on **Eject button** or **Right-click** to **stop the media playing**; press Escape or Enter key for main menu. See [Sevopedia reworks (Media Player)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-090-media-player). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5894+) See also [KI#141](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#141---fixed-sevopedia-media-player-3d-audio-previews-became-very-quiet-after-entering-a-game).
 - New **Movies category** (bik, nif, dds) for **Victories**, **Wonders**, **Projects**, **Religions**, **Corporations** (if any; as of now in base AdvCiv there are none), and **Eras**, additional **audio support for non-bik** files (e.g. Religions have a nif + separate audio asset). **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to their entry in Sevopedia Movies. See [Sevopedia reworks (Movies (with audio support))](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-091-movies-category-with-audio-support).
 - New **Music category**: allows to play **~1750 audio scripts** (i.e. files) in Sevopedia, notably for **Techs**, **Leaders**, **Eras**, **Civilizations**, and many other. **Play button** added in related Sevopedia categories to redirect to Sevopedia Music. Approach broadly similar to that of Sevopedia Movies. **Search bar support** and **widening** allows to find desired tracks. Note: there are **multiple sounds in an item** for each civilization sound item, so **replay many times the same item to hear all civilization sounds**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Music)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-092-music-category-1750-audio-scripts-playable-in-sevopedia).
 - New **Expanded Text Panels** so History/Background **text** (e.g. of the Viking unit that is long and requires scrolling to be seen or of the Great General Unit (that includes uniquenames that require scrolling to be scanned quickly)) easier to read, with **EXPAND** and **CLOSE** buttons. It occupies the whole item's page but **preserves the rest of the sevopedia page display** (footer, header, item bar and category bar) for easy browsing. This allows to **browse other category items** (e.g., other leaders from sevopedia leader's item bar) **without having to close and reopen expanded view** everytime item is changed (e.g. when clicking on another leader). Added as an optional helper shared across all eligible categories (main code in [_sevopedia_helpers.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/_sevopedia_helpers.py)). Added optional **Playground** to experiment with **text color**, **background**, and **panel styles**, with `+` and `-` button to swap them and descriptions like `TEXT: PLAYER_LIGHT_BLUE_TEXT (147,188,252,255) (57/129)`,  `BG: MAINMENU_SLIDESHOW_LOAD (2/8)`, and `STYLE: PANEL_STYLE_MAIN_TAN (36/50)`: helps choosing or testing optimal art style without having to tediously manually testing them one by one. See [Sevopedia reworks (Expanded text panel)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-093-expanded-text-panel-with-expand-and-close-buttons).

